Location      : India
Start Date      : Aug 2013   End Date: Aug 2014

Role : Senior Software Developer

Project Description :

The Global FX Program aims to establish HSBC as the preferred provider of world-class FX products
and services in the retail banking sector globally. HSBC's FX Order Watching service will allow
customer to set their own target FX rate via HSBC's internet or mobile banking service, branches or
call center to either:
1.Be alerted when the FX rate is hit
2.Convert funds automatically within their accounts when the FX rate is hit.
The HSBC FX Order Watch service is targeted at customer with at customers with ratial FX needs
seeking optimized rates for transactional purpose and also customer wishing to take advantage if FX
movements to benefit their portfolios.


